      "content": "i know, i know... the hotlines and the resources. i've heard it all. it doesn't change the fact that every morning i wake up and realize i'm just performing these same soul-crushing tasks for someone who isn't even really there anymore. it’s like i’m stuck in a loop of watching things die. i don't even feel like a person anymore, just a machine that manages a dying body. it just feels so pointless.",
